<title>HONG KONG: Indosuez W.I. Carr sets call warrants on red-chips.</title>
<headline>Indosuez W.I. Carr sets call warrants on red-chips.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W.I. Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Friday it plans to issue 800 million American-style call warrants on a basket of three red-chip stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Everbright-IHD Pacific Ltd	    0.1794 shrs</p>
<p> CITIC Pacific Ltd				 0.0707 shrs</p>
<p>China Merchants Hai Hong Holdings Co Ltd  0.1870 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$4.595	 PREMIUM	 16.50 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1353	GEARING	 3.77x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  17.APR.98	EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$5.105</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
